    "id": "/media/manifests/av-cover.json",
    "type": "Manifest",
    "label": {
        "en": ["Audio canvas — cover art and waveform on one canvas"]
    },
    "summary": {
        "en": [
            "One Sound canvas carrying all three at once: the recording, an `accompanyingCanvas` holding the cover image core paints in the rect, and `seeAlso` waveform data. The combination decides where the peaks go — a canvas core paints a companion into gets no timeline lane, so the waveform reaches the reader as the transport scrubber's strip instead. Single-bodied on purpose: a temporally composed canvas takes no waveform at all, whatever else it carries."
        ]
    },
